1
00:01:48,479 --> 00:01:52,670
{\an8}[A Good Day to Ascend]

2
00:01:54,600 --> 00:02:00,780
{\an8}[Sedutan episod lalu]

3
00:01:54,720 --> 00:01:56,758
Apabila matahari di dunia luar terbenam,

4
00:01:56,759 --> 00:01:59,499
Sungai Nai akan muncul semula,
Alam Roh menyerang,

5
00:01:59,500 --> 00:02:01,479
dunia tokong besar kembali ke Alam Roh,

6
00:02:01,480 --> 00:02:03,609
semua patung dewa akan hidup semula.

7
00:02:03,610 --> 00:02:06,839
Mereka bakal melancarkan
pembunuhan beramai-ramai!

8
00:02:06,840 --> 00:02:08,099
Bersatu dengan saya,

9
00:02:08,100 --> 00:02:09,620
jadilah saya!

10
00:02:09,759 --> 00:02:11,999
Saya akan beri kamu kemuliaan tertinggi

11
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:13,920
dan kehidupan abadi!

12
00:02:17,680 --> 00:02:21,140
Tak sangka mereka
berjaya bunuh Pegawai Kehakiman Yongzhou,

13
00:02:21,400 --> 00:02:22,079
Zhou Zheng!

14
00:02:24,660 --> 00:02:29,740
{\an8}[Episod 21:
Tulang Putih Menghentam Dewa]

15
00:02:36,780 --> 00:02:38,380
Ada orang di belakang pokok.

16
00:02:47,820 --> 00:02:49,940
Alamak, dah kantoi!

17
00:03:05,400 --> 00:03:06,970
Rupanya Hantu Wuchang.

18
00:03:12,360 --> 00:03:13,160
Nasib baik,

19
00:03:13,470 --> 00:03:14,870
dapat tipu mereka.

20
00:03:15,870 --> 00:03:16,400
Eh?

21
00:03:16,680 --> 00:03:19,079
Saya boleh faham
bahasa hantu dan dewa ini.

22
00:03:19,680 --> 00:03:21,010
Hebat betul topeng ini.

23
00:03:22,110 --> 00:03:23,630
Pegang ini.

24
00:03:30,079 --> 00:03:31,280
Ikut.

25
00:04:14,600 --> 00:04:15,720
Mari sini.

26
00:04:23,920 --> 00:04:26,680
Budak ini nampak mencurigakan.

27
00:04:26,930 --> 00:04:28,410
Pengecut.

28
00:04:41,400 --> 00:04:44,640
Biar Hantu Wuchang ini
pegang Pil Semua Makhluk.

29
00:04:55,159 --> 00:04:56,820
Banyaknya Pil Semua Makhluk.

30
00:04:57,550 --> 00:04:58,519
Kalau saya ambil semua

31
00:04:58,520 --> 00:04:59,600
dan lari terus...

32
00:05:03,160 --> 00:05:05,690
Mesti saya mati
dengan cara yang mengerikan.

33
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:08,479
Pil Semua Makhluk sepatutnya

34
00:05:08,480 --> 00:05:11,219
dipersembahkan kepada
Dewa Nuo berjubah putih itu.

35
00:05:11,220 --> 00:05:13,709
Dewa-dewa ini tak dapat
mengenal pasti identiti kita,

36
00:05:13,710 --> 00:05:15,839
tapi Dewa Nuo berjubah putih itu
berpengalaman luas,

37
00:05:15,840 --> 00:05:18,170
mesti tahu saya Hantu Wuchang yang palsu.

38
00:05:19,680 --> 00:05:21,480
Saya tak boleh ikut mereka lagi.

39
00:05:30,540 --> 00:05:31,500
Ikut!

40
00:05:34,720 --> 00:05:36,080
Tak gunalah orang ini,

41
00:05:36,200 --> 00:05:37,530
masih perhatikan saya.

42
00:05:38,880 --> 00:05:41,079
Saya nak makan semua
Pil Semua Makhluk ini.

43
00:05:41,080 --> 00:05:43,399
Tengok macam mana kamu nak jelaskan
kepada Dewa Nuo Hantu.

44
00:05:43,400 --> 00:05:44,600
Semua mati bersama.

45
00:05:52,520 --> 00:05:53,720
Tak boleh makan saja,

46
00:05:54,280 --> 00:05:56,080
saya tambah sesuatu untuk kamu.

47
00:06:07,200 --> 00:06:08,200
Saya dah bebas?

48
00:06:12,890 --> 00:06:14,660
Dah agak tak semudah itu.

49
00:06:35,640 --> 00:06:37,999
Dah begitu lama dia mengejar
untuk membunuh.

50
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:39,519
Saya rasa kekuatan Dewa Nuo sekarang

51
00:06:39,520 --> 00:06:43,450
tak sampai satu peratus pun
daripada kekuatannya ketika di kemuncak.

52
00:06:45,400 --> 00:06:47,060
Kita pergi sekat pintu masuk!

53
00:06:48,610 --> 00:06:50,759
Nak pergi pintu masuk Tokong Shuikou?

54
00:06:50,760 --> 00:06:51,769
Baguslah!

55
00:06:51,770 --> 00:06:54,030
Ini masa yang sesuai untuk larikan diri.

56
00:07:05,930 --> 00:07:07,650
Ramai dewa jaga di sini.

57
00:07:08,280 --> 00:07:10,280
Susahlah orang di dalam nak keluar.

58
00:07:10,890 --> 00:07:13,130
Harap Tuan Loceng dan Yuan Qi dah lari.

59
00:07:19,370 --> 00:07:21,179
Selepas keluar dari pintu ini,

60
00:07:21,180 --> 00:07:22,380
kita pun bebas!

61
00:07:22,960 --> 00:07:24,000
Tokong buruk ini,

62
00:07:24,610 --> 00:07:26,340
saya memang tak nak balik lagi.

63
00:07:45,510 --> 00:07:47,059
Tengoklah awak takut macam ini.

64
00:07:47,060 --> 00:07:48,408
Kami ada di sini, tak perlu takutlah.

65
00:07:48,409 --> 00:07:49,770
Pengecut.

66
00:07:54,840 --> 00:07:56,949
Lidahnya panjang,

67
00:07:56,950 --> 00:07:58,400
tapi seorang penakut.

68
00:08:00,360 --> 00:08:01,820
Topeng saya dah nak jatuh.

69
00:08:04,160 --> 00:08:06,720
Biar saya ajar dia jadi lebih berani.

70
00:08:27,400 --> 00:08:29,520
Aduhai!

71
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:34,120
Dia penipu!

72
00:08:34,740 --> 00:08:36,870
Pil Semua Makhluk ada pada penipu ini!

73
00:08:37,140 --> 00:08:39,380
Cepat kejarlah!

74
00:08:42,880 --> 00:08:45,069
Nampaknya Ying memang bernasib baik
dan sentiasa dilindungi.

75
00:08:45,070 --> 00:08:45,680
Ying!

76
00:09:17,290 --> 00:09:18,090
Saya halang!

77
00:09:20,130 --> 00:09:21,330
Berkesan juga.

78
00:09:21,790 --> 00:09:24,390
Pil Semua Makhluk ini
memang sangat berharga.

79
00:09:25,810 --> 00:09:26,680
Saya halang!

80
00:09:30,520 --> 00:09:31,120
Saya elak!

81
00:09:31,280 --> 00:09:31,880
Saya elak!

82
00:09:32,100 --> 00:09:32,830
Saya halang!

83
00:09:40,200 --> 00:09:41,159
Nak dapatkan ini?

84
00:09:41,160 --> 00:09:42,490
Pulangkan kepada awak!

85
00:09:44,400 --> 00:09:45,119
Pergilah!

86
00:09:45,120 --> 00:09:45,839
Cepat kejar!

87
00:09:45,840 --> 00:09:46,770
Cepat kejarlah!

88
00:09:50,680 --> 00:09:51,240
Ying!

89
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:54,330
Kenapa kejar saya lagi?

90
00:10:00,720 --> 00:10:01,919
Hanya tinggal satu di belakang!

91
00:10:01,920 --> 00:10:03,359
Pusing balik dan lawannya!

92
00:10:03,360 --> 00:10:04,490
Tak dapat lawannya.

93
00:10:04,640 --> 00:10:05,370
Tuan Loceng!

94
00:10:05,640 --> 00:10:07,679
Dah lama saya bela awak,
sekarang masa untuk awak berbakti!

95
00:10:07,680 --> 00:10:09,119
Boleh awak gunakan kuasa sakti
untuk hapuskannya?

96
00:10:09,120 --> 00:10:10,619
Hapus apa bendanya?

97
00:10:10,620 --> 00:10:12,479
Kalau awak betul-betul
bela saya begitu lama,

98
00:10:12,480 --> 00:10:15,399
walaupun sepuluh musuh datang,
saya boleh ketuk semuanya sampai mati!

99
00:10:15,400 --> 00:10:16,960
Cepat lari!

100
00:10:29,680 --> 00:10:30,960
Sakitnya!

101
00:10:36,440 --> 00:10:37,840
Teruk sangatkah?

102
00:10:39,830 --> 00:10:41,380
Ini Cambuk Pemukul Roh.

103
00:10:41,480 --> 00:10:42,680
Sebaik saja terkena,

104
00:10:42,860 --> 00:10:44,369
cambuk itu akan menyerang roh seseorang,

105
00:10:44,370 --> 00:10:45,509
sangat sakit.

106
00:10:45,510 --> 00:10:48,240
Tiada sesiapa yang mampu
menahan kesakitannya.

107
00:10:49,850 --> 00:10:52,490
Rasa pening sikit tadi.

108
00:10:52,620 --> 00:10:54,150
Tuan Loceng cakap apa tadi?

109
00:11:10,070 --> 00:11:11,150
Saya faham dah!

110
00:11:11,680 --> 00:11:13,840
Cambuk Pemukul Roh ini dah rosak!

111
00:11:19,130 --> 00:11:21,929
Mungkin sebab saya makan
banyak Pil Semua Makhluk,

112
00:11:21,930 --> 00:11:24,790
jadi Cambuk Pemukul Roh ini
tak berkesan bagi saya.

113
00:11:39,310 --> 00:11:40,350
Ying!

114
00:11:58,970 --> 00:12:00,330
Memang begitu sakit?

115
00:12:15,490 --> 00:12:17,279
Malah boleh mematahkan
Pedang Terbang Kuasa Dupa?

116
00:12:17,280 --> 00:12:18,940
Memang satu harta yang hebat!

117
00:12:21,200 --> 00:12:22,120
Cantik!

118
00:12:26,120 --> 00:12:27,159
Jom kita balik ke Gunung Kosong.

119
00:12:27,160 --> 00:12:28,920
Hebatlah awak.

120
00:12:40,280 --> 00:12:41,360
Anak muda.

121
00:12:42,760 --> 00:12:44,680
Kenapa tak duduk sekejap?

122
00:12:45,960 --> 00:12:46,640
Ying.

123
00:12:46,840 --> 00:12:48,300
Dia nampak berniat jahat.

124
00:12:48,640 --> 00:12:50,479
Mereka dah bersiap sedia di sini.

125
00:12:50,480 --> 00:12:52,599
Jelas sekali mereka dah lama menunggu,

126
00:12:52,600 --> 00:12:54,600
takkan lepaskan kita dengan mudah.

127
00:13:15,410 --> 00:13:17,290
Pak cik kenal saya?

128
00:13:17,570 --> 00:13:18,760
Kenallah.

129
00:13:19,200 --> 00:13:20,440
Semasa awak kecil,

130
00:13:21,010 --> 00:13:22,970
saya pernah dukung awak.

131
00:13:23,880 --> 00:13:25,540
Kenapa saya tak ingat pak cik?

132
00:13:26,520 --> 00:13:28,580
Saya tinggal di Kampung Keluarga Xu.

133
00:13:29,070 --> 00:13:31,509
Ayah saya anak ketiga,
namanya Xu Sanlang.

134
00:13:31,510 --> 00:13:34,279
Mak saya dari kampung sebelah,
namanya Luo Yinghua.

135
00:13:34,280 --> 00:13:36,079
Saya anak kedua dalam keluarga,

136
00:13:36,080 --> 00:13:37,140
ada seorang kakak.

137
00:13:38,880 --> 00:13:39,600
Tak betul.

138
00:13:40,420 --> 00:13:41,280
Saya tak ada...

139
00:13:41,450 --> 00:13:42,410
Tak ada kakak.

140
00:13:42,730 --> 00:13:44,759
Alamak, penyakit Ying menyerang lagi.

141
00:13:44,760 --> 00:13:48,220
Sejak kecil lagi, awak memang
sering mengalami sakit kepala.

142
00:13:48,890 --> 00:13:49,650
Ying!

143
00:13:50,040 --> 00:13:52,000
Sampai sekarang pun belum sembuh.

144
00:13:53,010 --> 00:13:55,410
Kesianlah awak.

145
00:13:55,930 --> 00:13:57,130
Silakan.

146
00:13:59,640 --> 00:14:00,520
Minumlah.

147
00:14:01,360 --> 00:14:04,360
Dah berjalan jauh, mesti awak dah haus.

148
00:14:13,720 --> 00:14:14,880
Pak cik mesti tahu

149
00:14:15,040 --> 00:14:17,100
banyak perkara masa saya kecil, kan?

150
00:14:19,610 --> 00:14:21,279
Budak tak guna.

151
00:14:21,280 --> 00:14:24,480
Budak yang bela ular besar itu,

152
00:14:25,210 --> 00:14:27,850
awak bersembunyi di mana?

153
00:14:28,170 --> 00:14:29,599
Keluar!

154
00:14:29,600 --> 00:14:31,640
Ia tak dapat cari tempat saya.

155
00:14:32,490 --> 00:14:34,810
Awak tak perlu risau.

156
00:14:46,780 --> 00:14:47,820
Pemurni tenaga?

157
00:14:48,640 --> 00:14:50,219
Bukankah gadis di dalam keranda itu cakap

158
00:14:50,220 --> 00:14:51,700
pemurni tenaga dah pupus?

159
00:14:52,760 --> 00:14:55,440
Orang tua yang nampak sedih ini dari mana?

160
00:14:56,520 --> 00:15:02,120
Dewa Nuo di Tokong Shuikou
bernama Chen Mianzhu.

161
00:15:02,710 --> 00:15:05,510
Dia memang memiliki bakat yang luar biasa,

162
00:15:05,800 --> 00:15:08,000
malah dikurniakan tuah yang banyak.

163
00:15:08,720 --> 00:15:11,039
Selepas mewarisi ilmu bomoh Nuo,

164
00:15:11,040 --> 00:15:13,100
dia membuka Khazanah Rahsia Yujing.

165
00:15:13,750 --> 00:15:15,280
Hanya dalam seratus tahun,

166
00:15:15,920 --> 00:15:18,600
dia telah mencapai tahap Dewa Nuo.

167
00:15:19,680 --> 00:15:21,840
Apabila dia mencapai tahap Dewa Nuo,

168
00:15:22,310 --> 00:15:25,430
dia sedar hayatnya terbatas.

169
00:15:26,230 --> 00:15:28,970
Jadi, dia membina Tokong Shuikou

170
00:15:29,360 --> 00:15:31,719
yang menghubungkan alam manusia
dengan alam roh

171
00:15:31,720 --> 00:15:35,520
untuk menjadi Dewa Nuo yang abadi.

172
00:15:36,680 --> 00:15:38,920
Sehinggalah suatu hari...

173
00:15:39,480 --> 00:15:40,919
Sehinggalah suatu hari,

174
00:15:40,920 --> 00:15:42,439
sebilah pedang tiba-tiba menyerang.

175
00:15:42,440 --> 00:15:45,199
Seorang pendekar yang amat hebat
memasuki tempat pertapaannya,

176
00:15:45,200 --> 00:15:46,360
lalu membunuhnya.

177
00:15:46,740 --> 00:15:48,540
Bukan membunuhnya,

178
00:15:49,450 --> 00:15:51,770
tapi memakannya.

179
00:15:53,270 --> 00:15:54,190
Memakannya?

180
00:15:54,650 --> 00:15:56,370
Dia dimakan sampai bersih,

181
00:15:56,900 --> 00:15:59,740
tak sanggup bazir sedikit pun.

182
00:16:00,340 --> 00:16:03,140
Makan sampai tinggal kulitnya.

183
00:16:10,730 --> 00:16:11,650
Ying!

184
00:16:14,840 --> 00:16:17,840
Sebab itulah dia dipenuhi dendam
yang amat mendalam.

185
00:16:18,270 --> 00:16:22,470
Kini, dia hanya tinggal
sedikit sisa kesedaran.

186
00:16:25,080 --> 00:16:26,800
Patutlah dia nampak kuat,

187
00:16:27,190 --> 00:16:28,650
tapi, taklah sekuat mana.

188
00:16:31,840 --> 00:16:35,590
Sila teruskan perjalanan, Tuan Muda Xu.

189
00:16:38,960 --> 00:16:39,720
Ying.

190
00:16:40,710 --> 00:16:41,370
Ying.

191
00:16:48,120 --> 00:16:49,380
Terima kasih, pak cik.

192
00:16:50,280 --> 00:16:51,210
Saya pergi dulu.

193
00:16:59,690 --> 00:17:01,090
Baguslah sekarang,

194
00:17:01,990 --> 00:17:04,719
boleh hidup aman
selama beberapa puluh tahun lagi!

195
00:17:04,720 --> 00:17:05,259
Tuan Loceng,

196
00:17:05,260 --> 00:17:05,720
Yuan Qi,

197
00:17:05,960 --> 00:17:07,290
balik ke Gunung Kosong.

198
00:17:08,810 --> 00:17:09,569
Baiklah.

199
00:17:12,280 --> 00:17:13,560
Apa yang berlaku?

200
00:17:18,349 --> 00:17:21,880
Nenek Meng, rupa-rupanya awak memang
campur air dalam teh ini!

201
00:17:34,480 --> 00:17:35,560
Mana payung saya?

202
00:17:36,300 --> 00:17:38,300
Si jahat mana yang curi payung saya?

203
00:17:59,890 --> 00:18:06,320
{\an8}[Pratonton Episod Seterusnya]

204
00:18:01,840 --> 00:18:02,720
Bangun!

205
00:18:04,960 --> 00:18:06,800
Tangkap mereka!

206
00:18:08,320 --> 00:18:09,580
Orang ini sangat kuat.

207
00:18:10,330 --> 00:18:11,790
Jika berlawan dengannya,

208
00:18:13,560 --> 00:18:14,440
saya akan mati.

